  "items": [
    {
      "name": "Hand Crossbow",
      "quantity": 1,
      "description": "<p>Sometimes referred to as an alley bow by rogues or ruffians, this small crossbow fires small bolts that are sometimes used to deliver poison to the target. It's small enough to be shot one-handed, but it still requires two hands to load.</p>",
      "level": 0,
      "price": "3 gp ",
      "traits": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Shortsword",
      "quantity": 1,
      "description": "<p>These blades come in a variety of shapes and styles, but they are typically 2 feet long.</p>",
      "level": 0,
      "price": "9 sp ",
      "traits": [
        "agile",
        "finesse",
        "versatile-s"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Leather Armor",
      "quantity": 1,
      "description": "<p>A mix of flexible and molded boiled leather, a suit of this type of armor provides some protection with maximum flexibility.</p>",
      "level": 0,
      "price": "2 gp ",
      "traits": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Black Adder Venom",
      "quantity": 5,
      "description": "<p>Adder venom is a simple but effective way to enhance a weapon.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <img src=\"assets/images/actions/2.png\" title=\"2 actions\" alt=\"2 actions\"> Interact (Injury)</p>\n<p><strong>Saving Throw</strong> DC 18 Fortitude save</p>\n<p><strong>Maximum Duration</strong> 3 rounds</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 1</strong> <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">1d8</span> poison damage (1 round)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 2</strong> <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">1d10</span> poison damage (1 round)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 3</strong> <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">2d6</span> poison damage (1 round)</p>",
      "level": 2,
      "price": "6 gp ",
      "traits": [
        "alchemical",
        "consumable",
        "injury",
        "poison"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Bolts",
      "quantity": 10,
      "description": "<p>Shorter than traditional arrows but similar in construction, bolts are the ammunition used by crossbows.</p>",
      "level": 0,
      "price": "1 sp ",
      "traits": []
    }
